'''Frost Breath''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|dragon shout]] that deals [[Skyrim:Frost_Damage|frost damage]] to enemies.

{{NewLeft}}
== Dragonborn Frost{{DB}} ==
After completing the [[Skyrim:The Gardener of Men|quest]] inside the Black Book ''[[Skyrim:Black Book: Epistolary Acumen (book)|Epistolary Acumen]]'' there are three abilities to choose from. One of them, [[Skyrim:Dragonborn Frost|Dragonborn Frost]], encases enemies in an ice block (wherein they can be attacked and the ice will not break, but the enemy encased in ice will take less damage) for 15 seconds, turning the shout into a variation of [[Skyrim:Ice_Form|Ice Form]].

